 "brief_title": "AVANDAMET Versus Metformin For Type 2 Diabetes Mellitus",
 "official_title": "AVANDAMET Compared to Metformin Evaluation Trial (ACME): A 48-week Randomized, Open-label, Multicenter Study to Compare the Efficacy and Tolerability of AVANDAMET to Metformin Monotherapy in Subjects With Type 2 Diabetes Mellitus Who Are Not Achieving Glycemic Control on Submaximal Metformin.",
